{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05123","headline":"送卢管记仙客北伐 · 沈佺期","name":"送卢管记仙客北伐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽檄西北飞，交城日夜围。\n庙堂盛徵选，戎幕生光辉。\n雁行度函谷，马首向金微。\n湛湛山川暮，萧萧凉气稀。\n饯途予悯默，赴敌子英威。\n今日杨朱泪，无将洒铁衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}